Scope: this proves physical identity and a partial bounded Message/inventory audit. It checks typed SCHEDULED timeline/expiry indexes and reports conservative status dispositions, including the Message-embedded blocker for open Attempt obligations, but does not verify the corresponding Attempt/Admission/Journal owner closure or the full legacy cross-record obligations, old TimelineEntry/Profile semantics, terminal owners, Lane control, replay source bytes after the checkpoint, produce the full per-Shard dry-run report, establish durable migration activation, convert a Store, or authorize rollback/reader retirement. B6 remains `IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION`.
